{
	"type": "root",
	"children": [
		{
			"type": "yaml",
			"value": "title: instant\ndescription: Configure instant navigation validation for a route segment."
		},
		{
			"type": "paragraph",
			"children": [
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": "The "
				},
				{
					"type": "inlineCode",
					"value": "instant"
				},
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": " route segment config controls how Next.js validates whether a navigation into this segment would produce an instant UI."
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"type": "paragraph",
			"children": [
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": "Next.js uses prefetching to preload navigations for all in-app links on the current page. However, client-side data fetching or partially prerendered results from the server can lead to navigations that don't update the UI immediately. To help you build fast-feeling navigations, "
				},
				{
					"type": "inlineCode",
					"value": "instant"
				},
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": " lets you tell Next.js what to expect from navigations through the configured segment. For instance, you can indicate that navigations into this segment should produce a UI that renders instantly without waiting on any externally loaded data. You can also indicate that navigations aren't expected to be instant."
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"type": "paragraph",
			"children": [
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": "When a segment is configured to expect an instant UI, Next.js surfaces any code in your application that would block the navigation from updating the UI immediately. See the "
				},
				{
					"type": "link",
					"title": null,
					"url": "../../../02-guides/instant-navigation.md",
					"children": [
						{
							"type": "text",
							"value": "Instant Navigation guide"
						}
					]
				},
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": " for an end-to-end walkthrough."
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"type": "blockquote",
			"children": [
				{
					"type": "paragraph",
					"children": [
						{
							"type": "strong",
							"children": [
								{
									"type": "text",
									"value": "Good to know"
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"type": "text",
							"value": ":"
						}
					]
				},
				{
					"type": "list",
					"ordered": false,
					"start": null,
					"spread": false,
					"children": [
						{
							"type": "listItem",
							"spread": false,
							"checked": null,
							"children": [
								{
									"type": "paragraph",
									"children": [
										{
											"type": "text",
											"value": "The "
										},
										{
											"type": "inlineCode",
											"value": "instant"
										},
										{
											"type": "text",
											"value": " export only works when "
										},
										{
											"type": "link",
											"title": null,
											"url": "../../05-config/01-next-config-js/cacheComponents.md",
											"children": [
												{
													"type": "inlineCode",
													"value": "cacheComponents"
												}
											]
										},
										{
											"type": "text",
											"value": " is enabled."
										}
									]
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"type": "listItem",
							"spread": false,
							"checked": null,
							"children": [
								{
									"type": "paragraph",
									"children": [
										{
											"type": "inlineCode",
											"value": "instant"
										},
										{
											"type": "text",
											"value": " cannot be used in Client Components. It will throw an error."
										}
									]
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"type": "listItem",
							"spread": false,
							"checked": null,
							"children": [
								{
									"type": "paragraph",
									"children": [
										{
											"type": "text",
											"value": "Next.js does not perform prefetches in development, so navigations may not feel as instant as they will in production. Validation reflects what will happen during "
										},
										{
											"type": "inlineCode",
											"value": "next start"
										},
										{
											"type": "text",
											"value": ", where prefetching is enabled."
										}
									]
								}
							]
						}
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"type": "code",
			"lang": "tsx",
			"meta": "filename=\"layout.tsx | page.tsx\" switcher",
			"value": "export const instant = true\n\nexport default function Page() {\n\treturn <div>...</div>\n}"
		},
		{
			"type": "code",
			"lang": "jsx",
			"meta": "filename=\"layout.js | page.js\" switcher",
			"value": "export const instant = true\n\nexport default function Page() {\n\treturn <div>...</div>\n}"
		},
		{
			"type": "heading",
			"depth": 2,
			"children": [
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": "Reference"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"type": "paragraph",
			"children": [
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": "The export accepts:"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"type": "list",
			"ordered": false,
			"start": null,
			"spread": false,
			"children": [
				{
					"type": "listItem",
					"spread": false,
					"checked": null,
					"children": [
						{
							"type": "paragraph",
							"children": [
								{
									"type": "strong",
									"children": [
										{
											"type": "inlineCode",
											"value": "true"
										}
									]
								},
								{
									"type": "text",
									"value": ": Opts the segment into validation at whatever level is configured globally (see "
								},
								{
									"type": "link",
									"title": null,
									"url": "#configuring-validation-defaults",
									"children": [
										{
											"type": "text",
											"value": "Configuring validation defaults"
										}
									]
								},
								{
									"type": "text",
									"value": "). With the framework defaults, validation runs in development only and surfaces errors in the dev overlay."
								}
							]
						}
					]
				},
				{
					"type": "listItem",
					"spread": false,
					"checked": null,
					"children": [
						{
							"type": "paragraph",
							"children": [
								{
									"type": "strong",
									"children": [
										{
											"type": "inlineCode",
											"value": "false"
										}
									]
								},
								{
									"type": "text",
									"value": ": Opts the segment out (see "
								},
								{
									"type": "link",
									"title": null,
									"url": "#disabling-instant",
									"children": [
										{
											"type": "text",
											"value": "Disabling instant"
										}
									]
								},
								{
									"type": "text",
									"value": ")."
								}
							]
						}
					]
				},
				{
					"type": "listItem",
					"spread": false,
					"checked": null,
					"children": [
						{
							"type": "paragraph",
							"children": [
								{
									"type": "text",
									"value": "An "
								},
								{
									"type": "strong",
									"children": [
										{
											"type": "text",
											"value": "object"
										}
									]
								},
								{
									"type": "text",
									"value": ": Opts in with additional options. See "
								},
								{
									"type": "link",
									"title": null,
									"url": "#level",
									"children": [
										{
											"type": "inlineCode",
											"value": "level"
										}
									]
								},
								{
									"type": "text",
									"value": "."
								}
							]
						}
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"type": "heading",
			"depth": 3,
			"children": [
				{
					"type": "inlineCode",
					"value": "level"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"type": "paragraph",
			"children": [
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": "Sets the severity at which validation runs for this segment."
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"type": "code",
			"lang": "tsx",
			"meta": "filename=\"page.tsx\"",
			"value": "export const instant = {\n\tlevel: 'warning',\n}"
		},
		{
			"type": "list",
			"ordered": false,
			"start": null,
			"spread": false,
			"children": [
				{
					"type": "listItem",
					"spread": false,
					"checked": null,
					"children": [
						{
							"type": "paragraph",
							"children": [
								{
									"type": "strong",
									"children": [
										{
											"type": "inlineCode",
											"value": "'warning'"
										}
									]
								},
								{
									"type": "text",
									"value": ": Validates in development only. Errors appear in the dev overlay; the build is unaffected."
								}
							]
						}
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"type": "paragraph",
			"children": [
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": "In the future a validation level that supports validation during build will be supported. Unless you are enabling experimental validation modes there is no need to specify level since the only level available is "
				},
				{
					"type": "inlineCode",
					"value": "\"warning\""
				},
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": "."
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"type": "paragraph",
			"children": [
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": "When "
				},
				{
					"type": "inlineCode",
					"value": "level"
				},
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": " is omitted (or "
				},
				{
					"type": "inlineCode",
					"value": "instant = true"
				},
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": " is used), the segment is validated at whatever level is configured globally — see "
				},
				{
					"type": "link",
					"title": null,
					"url": "#configuring-validation-defaults",
					"children": [
						{
							"type": "text",
							"value": "Configuring validation defaults"
						}
					]
				},
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": "."
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"type": "heading",
			"depth": 3,
			"children": [
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": "Disabling instant"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"type": "paragraph",
			"children": [
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": "Set "
				},
				{
					"type": "inlineCode",
					"value": "false"
				},
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": " on a layout or page to indicate that this segment is allowed to block when navigating to it."
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"type": "paragraph",
			"children": [
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": "This is useful when a deeper page should be instant but an ancestor can't be. For instance, if a shared layout cannot load instantly but you still want to assert that pages beneath this layout can be navigated to instantly, you can ensure that the pages have "
				},
				{
					"type": "inlineCode",
					"value": "instant = true"
				},
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": " while the shared layout has "
				},
				{
					"type": "inlineCode",
					"value": "instant = false"
				},
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": "."
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"type": "code",
			"lang": "tsx",
			"meta": "filename=\"app/tabs/layout.tsx\"",
			"value": "export const instant = false"
		},
		{
			"type": "code",
			"lang": "tsx",
			"meta": "filename=\"app/tabs/[tab]/page.tsx\"",
			"value": "export const instant = true"
		},
		{
			"type": "paragraph",
			"children": [
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": "Navigations from outside into a tab are allowed to block at the layout. Navigations between tabs are validated for instant UI."
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"type": "paragraph",
			"children": [
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": "You don't need to add "
				},
				{
					"type": "inlineCode",
					"value": "false"
				},
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": " to ancestors of an instant page just because they do something blocking — a higher-up "
				},
				{
					"type": "inlineCode",
					"value": "instant = true"
				},
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": " doesn't force its descendants to validate, and leaving an ancestor unconfigured is fine. Reach for "
				},
				{
					"type": "inlineCode",
					"value": "false"
				},
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": " only when you've configured a deeper page as instant and need to exempt navigations that pass through a blocking ancestor."
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"type": "heading",
			"depth": 3,
			"children": [
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": "Disabling static shell validation"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"type": "paragraph",
			"children": [
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": "Cache Components also validates that each page in your app produces a non-empty static shell at prerender time. To opt a route out of this validation, ensure the highest "
				},
				{
					"type": "inlineCode",
					"value": "instant"
				},
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": " config in the route's tree is "
				},
				{
					"type": "inlineCode",
					"value": "false"
				},
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": " — a "
				},
				{
					"type": "inlineCode",
					"value": "false"
				},
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": " higher in the tree takes precedence over any deeper "
				},
				{
					"type": "inlineCode",
					"value": "true"
				},
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": " for the static-shell check."
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"type": "paragraph",
			"children": [
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": "Setting "
				},
				{
					"type": "inlineCode",
					"value": "false"
				},
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": " on the root layout disables static shell validation for the entire app. Place the "
				},
				{
					"type": "inlineCode",
					"value": "false"
				},
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": " as low as possible — only as high as needed to cover the routes you want to opt out — so the rest of the app keeps validating."
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"type": "heading",
			"depth": 2,
			"children": [
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": "How validation works"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"type": "paragraph",
			"children": [
				{
					"type": "inlineCode",
					"value": "instant"
				},
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": " triggers validation at every shared layout boundary in the route. Validation runs during development (on page loads and HMR updates) and surfaces errors in the dev error overlay."
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"type": "paragraph",
			"children": [
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": "Each error identifies the component that would block navigation. The fix is usually to cache the data with "
				},
				{
					"type": "inlineCode",
					"value": "use cache"
				},
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": " or wrap it in a "
				},
				{
					"type": "inlineCode",
					"value": "<Suspense>"
				},
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": " boundary."
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"type": "heading",
			"depth": 2,
			"children": [
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": "How "
				},
				{
					"type": "inlineCode",
					"value": "instant"
				},
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": " differs from "
				},
				{
					"type": "inlineCode",
					"value": "ensureStatic"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"type": "paragraph",
			"children": [
				{
					"type": "inlineCode",
					"value": "instant"
				},
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": " validates whether a navigation shows UI immediately. "
				},
				{
					"type": "link",
					"title": null,
					"url": "./ensureStatic.md",
					"children": [
						{
							"type": "inlineCode",
							"value": "ensureStatic"
						}
					]
				},
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": " requires selected server-rendered output to be static instead of rendered for each request. A route can be fully static and still block a navigation, for example when a Client Component loads data in the browser."
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"type": "heading",
			"depth": 2,
			"children": [
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": "Configuring validation defaults"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"type": "paragraph",
			"children": [
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": "By default ("
				},
				{
					"type": "inlineCode",
					"value": "validationLevel: 'warning'"
				},
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": "), Cache Components apps validate every Page and Default segment in development. The "
				},
				{
					"type": "inlineCode",
					"value": "experimental.instantInsights.validationLevel"
				},
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": " config tunes this behavior — for example, to limit validation to segments that opt in explicitly via "
				},
				{
					"type": "inlineCode",
					"value": "instant"
				},
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": "."
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"type": "code",
			"lang": "js",
			"meta": "filename=\"next.config.js\"",
			"value": "module.exports = {\n\texperimental: {\n\t\tinstantInsights: {\n\t\t\tvalidationLevel: 'warning',\n\t\t},\n\t},\n}"
		},
		{
			"type": "paragraph",
			"children": [
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": "The supported levels are:"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"type": "list",
			"ordered": false,
			"start": null,
			"spread": false,
			"children": [
				{
					"type": "listItem",
					"spread": false,
					"checked": null,
					"children": [
						{
							"type": "paragraph",
							"children": [
								{
									"type": "strong",
									"children": [
										{
											"type": "inlineCode",
											"value": "'warning'"
										}
									]
								},
								{
									"type": "text",
									"value": " "
								},
								{
									"type": "emphasis",
									"children": [
										{
											"type": "text",
											"value": "(framework default)"
										}
									]
								},
								{
									"type": "text",
									"value": ": Every Page and Default segment is implicitly validated at warning level (dev only)."
								}
							]
						}
					]
				},
				{
					"type": "listItem",
					"spread": false,
					"checked": null,
					"children": [
						{
							"type": "paragraph",
							"children": [
								{
									"type": "strong",
									"children": [
										{
											"type": "inlineCode",
											"value": "'manual-warning'"
										}
									]
								},
								{
									"type": "text",
									"value": ": Only segments with an explicit "
								},
								{
									"type": "inlineCode",
									"value": "instant"
								},
								{
									"type": "text",
									"value": " are validated, at warning level (dev only)."
								}
							]
						}
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"type": "paragraph",
			"children": [
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": "Setting "
				},
				{
					"type": "inlineCode",
					"value": "instant = false"
				},
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": " on a segment opts it out of validation entirely."
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"type": "blockquote",
			"children": [
				{
					"type": "paragraph",
					"children": [
						{
							"type": "strong",
							"children": [
								{
									"type": "text",
									"value": "Good to know"
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"type": "text",
							"value": ":"
						}
					]
				},
				{
					"type": "list",
					"ordered": false,
					"start": null,
					"spread": false,
					"children": [
						{
							"type": "listItem",
							"spread": false,
							"checked": null,
							"children": [
								{
									"type": "paragraph",
									"children": [
										{
											"type": "text",
											"value": "The framework default may change in future versions to opt users into higher levels of validation. Because this feature is experimental, that change is not considered a breaking change. To pin a specific behavior, set "
										},
										{
											"type": "inlineCode",
											"value": "validationLevel"
										},
										{
											"type": "text",
											"value": " explicitly."
										}
									]
								}
							]
						},
						{
